ate with existing systems, including EMR/EHR/PMS connectivity, and are trusted by more than 80,000 providers and organizations across 180+ countries. For more information, visit www.physitrackgroup.com and follow us on LinkedIn and X."]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Enquiries regarding this announcement should be addressed to:"]}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Corporate Contact:"]}]},{"type":"p","children":["Henrik Molin, CEO and co-founder, Physitrack"]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"url","params":{"url":"http://mailto:ir@physitrack.com","linkText":"ir@physitrack.com"}}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"url","params":{"url":"http://mailto:media@physitrack.com","linkText":"media@physitrack.com"}}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Investor and Media Contact:"]}]},{"type":"p","children":["Investor Relations"]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"url","params":{"url":"http://mailto:Jonathan@harbor-access.com","linkText":"Jonathan@harbor-access.com"}}]},{"type":"p","children":["Tel +1 475 477 9401"]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Attachments"]}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://storage.mfn.se/79169349-4deb-4347-9494-36f0976dfd99/physitrack-plc-transactions-under-share-buy-back-programme.pdf","linkText":"Physitrack PLC — Transactions under Share Buy-back Programme"}}]}]},"language":"en","tags":[{"title":"MFN by Modular Finance","args":[{"id":"provider","value":"modular_finance"}]},{"title":"Share buybacks","args":[{"id":"section","value":"share_buybacks"}]},{"title":"Swedish stocks","args":[{"id":"category","value":"stock"},{"id":"market_country","value":"SE"}]}],"id":"modular_finance:e0ffc51867cf2:0","title":"Physitrack PLC — Transactions under Share Buy-back Programme","published":1788157800,"urgency":2,"relatedSymbols":[{"symbol":"OMXSTO:PTRK","logoid":"physitrack-plc","logo":{"style":"single","logoid":"physitrack-plc"}}],"storyPath":"/news/modular_finance:e0ffc